{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a moose on a diving adventure. Swim into the ocean and vacuum coins from the seabed. Sell the coins and earn money to upgrade and buy new gear. Swim deeper and find more valuable coins, but don\u2019t forget to keep an eye on your oxygen level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796710/extras/9311e6008f5aea6215854e33e24c4b86.avif?t=1753946126\" alt=\"Vacuum coins\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the water and vacuum coins from the seabed with your coin vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796710/extras/29b21db76789a905b3c817c7dfe68030.avif?t=1753946126\" alt=\"Sell and upgrade\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell the coins to <strong>Coin Collector Sir Floaty II Seahorse of Kiddie Pool</strong> he will pay a fair price for them. Use the money earned to buy upgrades to your gear and more in <strong>Barkie McBarkie\u2019s Divin gear n Stuff</strong>. He has the best prices on the island.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796710/extras/6ce668ec1f3210bde7a5fcacdfb26bc4.avif?t=1753946126\" alt=\"Dive deeper\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With your upgraded gear you will reach deeper parts of the ocean which hold more coins, But mind your oxygen level so you don\u2019t drown and lose the coins you have collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just a demo of the full game there are more features in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796710?t=1753946126","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796710?t=1753946126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796710/e022da68f6bec6fe562b9f828f4a3532acc0664a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753946126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796710/e022da68f6bec6fe562b9f828f4a3532acc0664a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753946126","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a moose on a diving adventure. Swim into the ocean and vacuum coins from the seabed. Sell the coins and earn money to upgrade and buy new gear. Swim deeper and find more valuable coins, but don\u2019t forget to keep an eye on your oxygen level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796710/extras/9311e6008f5aea6215854e33e24c4b86.avif?t=1753946126\" alt=\"Vacuum coins\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the water and vacuum coins from the seabed with your coin vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796710/extras/29b21db76789a905b3c817c7dfe68030.avif?t=1753946126\" alt=\"Sell and upgrade\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell the coins to <strong>Coin Collector Sir Floaty II Seahorse of Kiddie Pool</strong> he will pay a fair price for them. Use the money earned to buy upgrades to your gear and more in <strong>Barkie McBarkie\u2019s Divin gear n Stuff</strong>. He has the best prices on the island.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796710/extras/6ce668ec1f3210bde7a5fcacdfb26bc4.avif?t=1753946126\" alt=\"Dive deeper\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With your upgraded gear you will reach deeper parts of the ocean which hold more coins, But mind your oxygen level so you don\u2019t drown and lose the coins you have collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just a demo of the full game there are more features in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Lingon Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3738330","name":"Moose Diver"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796710/1a0d326ec37d51cbeb2db938f578ead759e8c516/header.jpg?t=1753946126","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175190,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175190/movie480.mp4?t=1753946123","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175190/movie_max.mp4?t=1753946123"},"name":"Announce trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175190/ab3d85c1e2124647773353ae5e07adb9ee568c39/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753946123","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175190/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753946123","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175190/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753946123"}}],"name":"Moose Diver Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><